GreenwichCountryDay -> Middletown[label="4.8
05/14", weight="96", tooltip="NEIRA,Notre Dame High School, Greenwich Country Day School, & Middletown High School			
Distance: 1500m Conditions: Mild downstream current with minimal to no wind. Floating starts. Slight turn to port at approximately 750m. Comments: Boys 2nd boat - GCDS & ND had slight high five about 15 seconds into the race, no hands were raised & points were already being adjusted, so race went on. Girls 1st boat - GCDS coxswain cut the turn buoy just barely on the far side of it, so a 5 second penalty was incurred (original time was 5:25.22).
